WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.530
2x plus 3 equals 11. Can you find x without guessing?

00:00:05.530 --> 00:00:08.750
Think of a balance. Both sides weigh the same.

00:00:08.750 --> 00:00:11.820
Take 3 from both sides. Still balanced.

00:00:11.820 --> 00:00:14.650
Now halve both sides to get one x.

00:00:14.650 --> 00:00:21.013
Check it: 2 times 4, plus 3, is 11. It works.
